// Push approvals (README, Push). Only with a paid Apple developer account: a free Personal Team
// cannot sign the push entitlement, so the target is based on this file only once there is one.
//
// development: a build run from Xcode, on APNs' sandbox. production: TestFlight and the App Store.
KOS_APS_ENVIRONMENT = development
CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = $(SRCROOT)/../App/Push.entitlements
